      en: "Tony wants to hand his armor over to Japan's Iron Man Dio program and retire. The terrorist organization Zodiac attacks with armors and robots and steals the project. Tony fights Zodiac's agents, who turn out to be tied to one of his collaborators, and the rogue Iron Man Dio prototype. Tony defeats it and decides to keep being Iron Man.",
