      en: "Mariko Yashida has been taken away by her father Shingen, a Yakuza boss, who wants to marry her off to expand his business. Wolverine chases her across Tokyo and Madripoor, fighting assassins, the ninja Yukio and his former ally Kikyo. He discovers Shingen leads a trafficking organization. Wolverine faces Shingen in a duel and defeats him, freeing Mariko.",
