      en: "Xavier calls Cyclops, Wolverine, Storm and Beast to Japan, where young Hisako Ichiki (Armor) has been kidnapped. They discover the U-Men organization is behind it, using mutants for their organs, and that some mutants are developing \"Secondary Mutation\". The final threat is tied to a young mutant with enormous power. The X-Men defeat it and Cyclops comes to terms with losing Jean.",
