      en: "Thor and Loki secretly leave Asgard to find the Sword of Surtur, accompanied by the Warriors Three. On the journey they meet Sif and Algrim, king of the Frost Giants. The sword turns out to be dangerous and corrupts whoever wields it. The journey teaches Thor the value of sacrifice and responsibility, a first step toward becoming worthy of his hammer.",
